<p>Returns the distance between two objects.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Float%20keyword" title="Float keyword">float</a> GetDistanceBetween(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oObjectA,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oObjectB<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObjectA<dd>The first object<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObjectB<dd>The second object
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Returns the distance between the two objects. Returns -1.0f on error.
</p>
