<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the distance between object oObjectA and object oObjectB. Distance is measured through three dimensional space and not just along the xy plane, so the hieght component of each object's location is relevant.
</p><p><br />
</p>
